      "text": "[7:05PM] #AirportRd #TrafficUpdate \n\nMovement from Oshodi Express inward Apakun and Nacho along the International Airport Road is presently favorable, with both service lanes and the main carriageway experiencing smooth traffic flow.\n\nGood inward Ajao Estate Gate to Fatai Irawo Junction, Awoniyi Elemo Junction, and Lateef Salami Street, connecting to Asa Afariogun Street.\nFrom Eleganza Roundabout inward Chivita, stretching down to Canoe towards NNPC Junction is good.\n\nThe return journey from NNPC Junction to Asa Afariogun Street, inward Osolo way towards 7 & 8 Junction, is also moving smoothly.\n\nTraffic movement is good from Aye Junction inward Osolo way, past Aswani Market, down to Aswani Roundabout.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
