      "text": "[7:11PM] #Badagry #TrafficUpdate \n\nSlow and Steady movement from Agbara Customs Check Point inward Badagry through Estate Gate down to Morogbo Junction.\n\nGood Movement from Morogbo through Ajibade, Odofa, Car Wash, Ibiye, magbon, Okoafo down to Badagry roundabout.\n\nReturn Journey from Badagry Roundabout back to Agbara Customs Check Point is free. \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
