      "text": "[7:30PM] #Dopemu #TrafficUpdate \n\nVehicular movement from Cement to Goye Junction towards Iyana Ipaja is smooth, with a similarly good return journey back to Goye Junction, connecting Akinwowo Junction towards Alaguntan Junction.\nTraffic movement is good on Babajide Sanwo Olu Road from Akowonjo Roundabout to Shasha Traffic Light.\nThe route from Vulcanizer Bus Stop to Ogunlana Egbeda is also experiencing good traffic flow.\n\nOfficers are actively managing traffic on ground, and no impediments have been reported. \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
