      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1944466767616856125",
      "text": "[7:35PM] #OguduAlapere #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic congestion descending Gbagada Bridge and Olopomeji connecting Car Wash down to Ifako Bus Stop has dissipated.\nHowever, traffic movement from Ifako Bus Stop towards Ogudu is slow due to ongoing construction of the damaged expansion joint at Ifako Bridge.\nLeaving Ifako Bridge, traffic movement towards Ogudu Estate, Alapere, and down to Apostolic Church is improving.\nThe route from Apostolic Church to Ojota Bridge, Ikosi Junction, Tollgate, and down to Otedola Bridge is experiencing smooth traffic flow.\nThe return journey from Otedola Bridge to Secretariat and down to Car Wash is also moving well.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
